{
  "description": "The agent transcript replica and the pane header's ticker, shared by the Mac (AgentPaneView, AgentACPTickerSource) and the desktop client (soyeht_client::agent::AgentView). Messages are transcript messages as the wire sends them. `merge` folds the steps in order (`update`: a message the engine pushed, which carries the whole message and replaces the known one; `page`: a fetched page, which may be older than what is held and never undoes a message that is further along) and lists what is held, in order. `ticker` lists the entries newest first for the transcript and the session title; the desktop joins them with its separator. How many earlier tool calls follow the current one is `capsTickerHistory` of x-clientPolicy.",
  "merge": [
    {
      "name": "a known message is replaced where it stands and the rest keep their sequence order",
      "steps": [
        {"update": {"localId": "b", "generation": 1, "seq": "2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "message", "text": "second", "complete": true}},
        {"update": {"localId": "a", "generation": 1, "seq": "1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "message", "text": "first", "complete": true}},
        {"update": {"localId": "b", "generation": 1, "seq": "2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "message", "text": "second, grown", "complete": true}}
      ],
      "messages": [{"localId": "a", "text": "first", "complete": true}, {"localId": "b", "text": "second, grown", "complete": true}]
    },
    {
      "name": "messages with one sequence are ordered by local id",
      "steps": [
        {"update": {"localId": "z", "generation": 1, "seq": "5", "role": "assistant", "kind": "message", "text": "z", "complete": true}},
        {"update": {"localId": "m", "generation": 1, "seq": "5", "role": "assistant", "kind": "message", "text": "m", "complete": true}}
      ],
      "messages": [{"localId": "m", "text": "m", "complete": true}, {"localId": "z", "text": "z", "complete": true}]
    },
    {
